   119	### 2.2 Lemma L (lattice points in a box) — proved
   120	
   121	For a lattice Λ ⊂ R² of covolume d with shortest vector length ρ, and any convex K of
   122	diameter D,
   123	
   124	  |#(Λ ∩ K) − area(K)/d| ≤ 1 + (4/√3)·D/ρ.
   125	
   126	For K = [0,X]² (or (0,X]²), D = √2X and the bound is 1 + 3.266X/ρ.
   127	
   128	*Proof.*
